{"n": 263, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "263.webp", "text": "13-30\n\nDDE\n1351005 ADJUSTING INJECTION PUMP\nSTATICALLY\n\nCoolant temperature at least 20° C (68° F)\nUnscrew plug (1),\n\nfastafiation\n\nTightening torque*\n\nScrew in Special Too! 13 5 330.\nMount dial gage with preload,\n\nTurn crankshaft clockwise in direction of TOC\nfor cylinder no. 1 (begin about 60 to 90°\nearlier) unl the needle remains at the lowest\npoint for some time.\n\nSet scale of dial gage to zero.\n\nPull out plug (2).\n\nTurn crankshaft clockwise until Special Tool\n11 2 300 engages in bore in flywheel at TOC.\nImportant!\n\nDont turn in direction opposite the engine's\nturning direction — wrong test results.\n\n* See Specifications\n\n, Ce\n\n%\n\n2114 650)\n\n21123651\n\nRead amount of distributor piston stroke on\ndial gage.\nTest value: 1.05 + 0.02 mm (0.0413 +0.0008\")\n\nAdjusting:\nUnscrew bolts (3 and 4).\n\nLoosen nuts (1 and 2), but not too much to\navoid tension from the toothed drive belt.\n\nTurn injection pump until dial gage shows the\ncorrect value\"\n\nTighten nuts in order of 1 through 4.\nTightening torque*\n\nRecheck adjustment\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["13-30", 0.4732, 0.0252, 0.5309, 0.0477], ["DDE", 0.2649, 0.0656, 0.2867, 0.0756], ["1351005", 0.266, 0.0809, 0.3136, 0.0922], ["ADJUSTING", 0.3267, 0.0816, 0.388, 0.0915], ["INJECTION", 0.3931, 0.0816, 0.4504, 0.0922], ["PUMP", 0.4549, 0.0816, 0.4833, 0.0922], ["STATICALLY", 0.3262, 0.0975, 0.3956, 0.1074], ["Coolant", 0.2649, 0.1293, 0.3019, 0.1406], ["temperature", 0.306, 0.1313, 0.3637, 0.1419], ["at", 0.3668, 0.132, 0.3754, 0.1399], ["least", 0.3794, 0.1306, 0.3997, 0.1399], ["20°", 0.4037, 0.1273, 0.4215, 0.1406], ["C", 0.425, 0.13, 0.4311, 0.1406], ["(68°", 0.4357, 0.1273, 0.4569, 0.1406], ["F)", 0.461, 0.13, 0.4706, 0.1412], ["Unscrew", 0.2649, 0.1459, 0.305, 0.1558], ["plug", 0.309, 0.1459, 0.3293, 0.1578], ["(1),", 0.3333, 0.1452, 0.3485, 0.1565], ["fastafiation", 0.2649, 0.1625, 0.3186, 0.1744